{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】【05:40】接載神二十四乘組的專車前往發射場。</p>\n<p>【05:32】神二十四乘組指令長由湯洪波擔任，帶同航天員武毅及阿里一同現身圓夢園廣場，向在場的民眾揮手，再逐一登上專車，在車隊的護送下，前往發射場。</p>\n<p>【05:28】神舟二十四號三名航天員出征儀式。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T22:04:22.315860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T21:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:57:52.731518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:57:52.731518+00:00","content_hash":"fdf76c615bdd18423a5e91d17461b1c297c40938e47cb0bfea1beb395cb7586b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}